  "task": "We're investigating a potential meningococcal disease outbreak linked to the Metro City Marathon, with multiple participants reporting severe headaches and neck stiffness post-race. I need to verify outbreak patterns, allocate antibiotics to local clinics, close the event venue, and issue public alerts to prevent further exposure."
